From d24b15c53bc1fd575ce5bf3e3969fd57469582e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: g00rek <76205606+g00rek@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:49:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Homa Lawn: no Screen control while pairing is on screen
 (patch 0035)

A paired computer with Screen control on could ask to pair from a new key and tap Accept with an
injected gesture. While the pairing screen is started, or any pair request is open, every screen.*
call but screen.status is refused with pairing_open: taps, swipes, keys, typing, launching, and the
tree and screenshot.
